sage', according to democracysausage.org.","source":"https://www.nine.com.au/australia-news/federal-election-2025-where-to-get-democracy-sausage-20250503-p5zd9h.html"}],"notes":"Labor won 94 of the 150 House seats (AEC). The Coalition won 43 seats: Liberal 18, LNP 16 and Nationals 9. The Senate uses STV, but this was not confirmed in the cited AEC report, so it is not stated.","verified":"2026-11-04 04:35 CT","nationalWinner":"Labor"}